- Arctic Wolf
(Consists of the Main Badge, Bug Hunter, Targeted Attack, & Data Shield)
- Red Light, Green Light
- Loading Error
- Hazbin Hotel
- Secret Badge Guide
- Fallout Caps
(Nuka Cola, Cherry Nuka Cola, & Quantum Cola)
- Pacman Gang
(Pacman, Inky, Blinky, Pinky, & Clyde)
- Foot Prints
- Family Night
(Burnie the Phoenix and Foxie)
- R2D2 Costume Party
- Light Cube Puzzle (Rubrik Cube)
- Warhammer
- Ubiquiti
- Trooper
- Empire

